[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_item_data")
item_name = "Arvid's Note"
item_description = "A note in Arvid's handwriting, left by the terminal."
item_type = 1
note_text = "\"Log note — 22:14

Still no signal. The office swears the mast down by the main road was upgraded last month. Funny how the network only ever works when they want something from me.

There's a sound coming out of the sunken tunnel at night. From the porch it's just wind in the metal — but the pitch shifts match the intervals I logged at Nest Gamma today. Not roughly. Exactly.

It's the acoustics of the hollow. It has to be. I'm going down to take a manual sample and rule out my own equipment before the report goes to the Institute.

Left the terminal running. Taking the spare battery cells. Back within the hour.

— Arvid\""
scene_to_spawn = ExtResource("2_note_scene")
